      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MARTINIQUE (8) racing well without winning, placing at her last four runs. Last start finished 2nd in a Grade 3/4 on September 24 over 300m at this track behind Neon Drift beaten 0.8 lengths (16.90). Has a strong record from box 8, including three wins. Makes plenty of appeal. KOORINGA KATE (6) boasts a strong record this journey here with four wins and two minors from eight tries. Below best last time at this track (17.40) in a Grade 5, finishing a 7 length sixth. Looks well placed here and among the chances. TIMELESS MISS (1) scored two back by a space then was last start always well back and could manage only a 10 length 7th at Grafton (25.97). Good beginner assisted by the inside draw. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. LADY BLAZINGTON (2) was out of the money here last time out but can bounce back.",
